index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..2f6bd07c958f08d6abd7a423119b3e6bddcd5d23
--- /dev/null
+++ b/MIGRATION_TODO.md
@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+# NeoForge 1.21.1 port - what the patch did and what is left
+
+The patch (generated by migrate.py) does the mechanical work and puts shims in
+`destiny.penumbra_phantasm.compat.legacy` so most call sites keep their shape.
+It has NOT been compiled by its author - the first CI run is expected to show
+compile errors. The workflow uploads the full log; fix by category below.
+
+## Done by the patch
+- Build: ModDevGradle 2.x, Gradle 8.10.2, Java 21, Parchment, `neoforge.mods.toml`
+- AT converted to Mojang names, `pack.mcmeta` -> format 34, mixin config (no refmap)
+- Data pack folders renamed to 1.21 singular names, recipe/advancement JSON converted
+- `forge:` tags -> `c:` tags, `forge:separate_transforms` loader -> `neoforge:`
+- Imports `net.minecraftforge.*` -> `net.neoforged.*`, `new ResourceLocation(..)` -> factories
+- `RegistryObject` -> `DeferredHolder<?, T>`, `ForgeRegistries` -> `BuiltInRegistries`
+- Networking: `LegacyChannel`/`PacketDistributor`/`NetworkEvent` shims over NeoForge payloads
+- Capabilities: attachment-backed `Capability`/`LazyOptional`/`LegacyCaps` shims
+  (`GenericProvider` + `CheshireChestCapability` removed; see `CapabilityRegistry`)
+- Main class constructor now `(IEventBus, ModContainer)`
+
+## Expect to fix by hand
+1. Item NBT (`getTag/getOrCreateTag/hasTag`, ~28 files) -> data components.
+   The rosegold lighter recipe already outputs component `penumbra_phantasm:uses`;
+   register a matching DataComponentType.
+2. Events: `TickEvent.*` -> `PlayerTickEvent.Post`, `ServerTickEvent.Post`, `LevelTickEvent.Post`,
+   `ClientTickEvent.Post`; `LivingChangeTargetEvent#getNewTarget` -> `getNewAboutToBeSetTarget`;
+   `LivingAttackEvent` was renamed to `LivingIncomingDamageEvent` (check getters).
+3. GUI overlays (`IGuiOverlay`, `RegisterGuiOverlaysEvent`, `VanillaGuiOverlay`) ->
+   `LayeredDraw.Layer` + `RegisterGuiLayersEvent`.
+4. Rendering: `BufferBuilder`/`Tesselator` changed (`BufferBuilder` returned by
+   `Tesselator.begin(mode, format)`, `.addVertex`/`.setColor`, `BufferUploader.drawWithShader(builder.buildOrThrow())`).
+5. Fluids: `FluidType`/`IClientFluidTypeExtensions`/`BaseFlowingFluid` registration; `ForgeFlowingFluid` -> `BaseFlowingFluid`.
+6. Items/blocks: `use`/`useOn`/`ItemStack` method signature changes (e.g. `InteractionResultHolder`,
+   `ItemInteractionResult` for block-use-with-item, `Item.Properties` components, tool tiers).
+7. Mob effects: `MobEffect` registration holders; `ForgeMod.SWIM_SPEED` etc. are `Holder<Attribute>` now.
+8. Codecs/data-pack registries: `DataPackRegistryEvent.NewRegistry` still exists; check codecs
+   for `ItemStack.CODEC`/`ResourceLocation` changes.
+9. Mixins: re-target against 1.21.1 (lighting engine, GameRenderer, LevelRenderer, Camera, etc.).
+10. Third-party APIs: GeckoLib 4.6.6 (4.4.9 -> 4.6 API), Player Animation Library
+    (`com.zigythebird.playeranim`; the old `dev.kosmx.playerAnim` API in `PlayerAnimator.java` is gone),
+    Curios (`CuriosApi.getCuriosInventory` returns `Optional`), Infiniverse, Fusion, JEI.
+    Dependencies for Infiniverse and Fusion are commented out in build.gradle: pin NeoForge 1.21.1 files.
+11. Level attachments: confirm `DarkFountainCapability`/`GreatDoorCapability` data persists per-dimension;
+    if not, move them to `SavedData`.
+12. `run-data/` contains stale logs/configs - safe to delete.
